+## Optional native decays
+
+Set `enableDecays=True` in `addFatras` (or the C++ Examples configuration) to
+simulate displaced K-short and Lambda/anti-Lambda decays, plus prompt pi0 decay.
+Both charged and neutral channels are included. No Geant4 runtime is required.
+See @ref fatras_decays for the physics approximations, acceptance and generator
+input contract. Decays are disabled by default and configured independently of
+material interactions.
