+## Native decays
+
+The optional @ref fatras_decays model samples proper lifetimes and two-body
+channels for K-short and Lambda/anti-Lambda without Geant4. Enable it separately
+with `enableDecays=True` to decay supported products of nuclear interactions as
+well as generator inputs. Its prompt pi0 channel shares the kinematics utility
+with the nuclear process; hadronic pi0 decays remain folded into the nuclear
+vertex. `Geant4Decay` remains an optional reference adapter.
